Changes made in this project:
- Reorganized the book's core ideas into 12 beginner learning stages.
- Added Chinese explanations, deterministic browser simulations,
  24 questions with feedback, reflection prompts and a glossary.
- Added responsive UI, local learning progress and Markdown notes export.

This is not an official course, and no endorsement by the original author
is implied. Simulations are educational examples, not reproduced results
of the book's real model experiments.

